  },
  "duration": 121.704,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Jacob spake many more things to my people at that time;",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.756,
      "end": 7.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless only these things have I caused to be written,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.465,
      "end": 10.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the things which I have written sufficeth me.",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.117,
      "end": 14.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, write more of the words of Isaiah,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.826,
      "end": 17.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for my soul delighteth in his words.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.374,
      "end": 20.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I will liken his words unto my people,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.201,
      "end": 22.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will send them forth unto all my children,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.167,
      "end": 25.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he verily saw my Redeemer,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.669,
      "end": 27.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as I have seen him.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.067,
      "end": 31.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my brother, Jacob, also has seen him as I have seen him;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.055,
      "end": 39.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I will send their words forth unto my children to prove unto them that my words are true.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.898,
      "end": 42.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, by the words of three,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.539,
      "end": 44.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "God hath said,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.205,
      "end": 45.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will establish my word.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.057,
      "end": 48.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, God sendeth more witnesses,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.931,
      "end": 50.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he proveth all his words.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 51.329,
      "end": 56.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my soul delighteth in proving unto my people the truth of the coming of Christ;",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.942,
      "end": 60.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, for this end hath the law of Moses been given;",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 60.791,
      "end": 67.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things which have been given of God from the beginning of the world, unto man, are the typifying of him.",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.251,
      "end": 72.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also my soul delighteth in the covenants of the Lord",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 72.332,
      "end": 74.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he hath made to our fathers;",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.066,
      "end": 77.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my soul delighteth in his grace,",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 77.614,
      "end": 85.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in his justice, and power, and mercy in the great and eternal plan of deliverance from death.",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 85.817,
      "end": 88.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my soul delighteth in proving unto my people",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 89.062,
      "end": 92.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that save Christ should come all men must perish.",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 93.179,
      "end": 95.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if there be no Christ there be no God;",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.145,
      "end": 98.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if there be no God we are not,",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 98.322,
      "end": 100.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there could have been no creation.",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 101.103,
      "end": 103.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But there is a God, and he is Christ,",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 103.744,
      "end": 106.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he cometh in the fulness of his own time.",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 107.21,
      "end": 109.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I write some of the words of Isaiah,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.944,
      "end": 112.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whoso of my people shall see these words",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 113.096,
      "end": 116.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "may lift up their hearts and rejoice for all men.",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 116.248,
      "end": 117.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these are the words,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 118.007,
      "end": 121.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye may liken them unto you and unto all men.",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    }
  ]
}